# IIS deployment (all microservices)

Each service that hosts on IIS uses **`{service}/deploy/`** as the site physical path. Reference implementation: [identity/deploy/IIS.md](../../identity/deploy/IIS.md).

## Standard layout

Replace `{service}` with the service folder (e.g. `identity`, `webonone-v2`).

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `{service}/deploy/` | IIS physical path (generated output — not repo root) |
| `{service}/deploy/web.config` | HttpPlatformHandler → `node dist/server.js` |
| `{service}/deploy/dist/` | Backend build (staged) |
| `{service}/deploy/public/` | Frontend build (staged; omit if backend-only) |
| `{service}/deploy/logs/` | Node stdout/stderr (IIS writes at runtime) |
| `{service}/backend/.env` | **Runtime** secrets — read by Node on IIS |
| `{service}/frontend/.env.production` | **Build-time** config — Vite embeds `VITE_*` into `deploy/public/` |
| Repo root `node_modules/` | Runtime deps — **not** copied into `deploy/` |

**Committed in `{service}/deploy/` only:** `web.config`, `stage-deploy.ps1`, `IIS.md`. Never commit staged `dist/`, `public/`, or `logs/`.

## Deploy commands

Per service (in `{service}/package.json`):

| Script | Purpose |
|--------|---------|
| `deploy` | Build + stage into `{service}/deploy/` |
| `stage:deploy` | Stage only (after a prior build) |
| `clean:deploy` | Remove generated output; keep committed deploy files |

From repo root (register `deploy:{service}` in root `package.json`):

```powershell
npm install
npm run migrate -w {service-root-workspace}   # when service has migrations
npm run deploy:{service}
```

`npm run dev:{service}` and `npm run build:{service}` do **not** touch `{service}/deploy/`.

## Environment (deploy-time split)

**Source of truth (ops/IIS machine only):** repo-root `production.env` (gitignored). Copy from [`production.env.example`](../../production.env.example), edit once.

| Script | Effect |
|--------|--------|
| `npm run env:apply` | Writes every `{service}/backend/.env` and `{service}/frontend/.env.production` |
| `npm run deploy:{service}` | Runs `env:apply`, then build + stage |

Runtime is unchanged: Node loads only `{service}/backend/.env`; Vite embeds `frontend/.env.production` at build time. Services must **not** `dotenv`-load `production.env`.

| Layer | File | When read |
|-------|------|-----------|
| Backend | `{service}/backend/.env` | Every IIS request (Node loads at startup) |
| Frontend | `{service}/frontend/.env.production` | Deploy build only — values compiled into JS; changes require redeploy |

**Do not** run `env:apply` / `deploy:*` on a laptop that uses local `backend/.env` for `npm run dev` unless you intend to overwrite those files.

Local `npm run dev` still uses per-service `frontend/.env` + `backend/.env` copied from each layer’s `.env.example`.

On IIS, HttpPlatformHandler sets `PORT` — backend must not override it when `IIS_NODE_HOSTED=1`.

Per-service env rules: [microservice-architecture.mdc](microservice-architecture.mdc).

## web.config rules (required)

- `PORT` = `%HTTP_PLATFORM_PORT%` — **never** hardcode a dev port
- `IIS_NODE_HOSTED=1` so backend loads `{service}/backend/.env` and serves `{service}/deploy/public/`
- Node path: `%ProgramFiles%\nodejs\node.exe` (adjust `processPath` if needed)
- App pool: **No Managed Code**; pool identity needs Read+Execute on `deploy/`, Read on `backend/.env`, Read+Execute on repo `node_modules/`, **Write** on `deploy/logs/`

## Redeploy

```powershell
# Edit production.env if secrets/origins changed, then:
git pull
npm run deploy:{service}
```

`deploy` always re-runs `env:apply` first. Recycle the IIS app pool or restart the site.

## Verification

| Check | Expected |
|-------|----------|
| `https://{host}/api/v1/health` | Service health JSON |
| `{service}/deploy/public/index.html` | Exists after deploy (when service has a frontend) |
| `{service}/deploy/logs/` | Inspect on 502/500 or startup failure |

Pre-deploy: `npm run type-check -w {service-root-workspace}`

## Common failures

| Symptom | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| 502.3 | Install HttpPlatformHandler; verify Node path in `web.config` |
| Page spins / timeout | Do not hardcode `PORT` in `web.config` |
| SPA 404 | Run deploy; confirm `deploy/public/` |
| API 404 from SPA | Rebuild frontend with `VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1` |
| DB errors | Run migrations; verify `DB_*` in `backend/.env` |

## Scaffolding a new service

Copy the pattern from `identity/deploy/` (`web.config`, `stage-deploy.ps1`, `IIS.md`, service `package.json` deploy scripts). Add root `deploy:{service}` script. Document host name and verify URLs in `{service}/deploy/IIS.md`.
